{# Shipping -- and the handling times inside it -- describes putting a thing #}
{# in a box and posting it. A DIGITAL product is emailed as a download link, #}
{# so advertising a delivery service, a postage price and a 1-21 day transit #}
{# window for one is a false statement to Google and to the customer reading #}
{# the listing. Same rule as checkout, which asks for a shipping address     #}
{# only when is_physical_good() is true.                                     #}

